    "title": "Prank sound: Hair Cut & Fart",
    "description": "Get ready for endless laughter and amusement with our Air Horn, Fart & Haircut Prank app. From Hair clipper sounds to outrageous practical jokes and prank sounds \ud83d\ude1d\ud83d\ude1d\ud83d\ude1d\r\n    \r\n\u2668\ufe0f KEY FEATURES: \r\n\r\n<font color=\"red\">\u274c Vast Sound Library</font>\r\nChoose from a range of quirky prank sounds such as air horns, burps, toilet flushing, hair clippers and more. Every sound is sure to leave your audience in stitches! \r\n\r\n<font color=\"red\">\u23f0 Prank Timer Setup</font>\r\nThe perfect prank by scheduling sound triggers with the built-in prank timer. Walk away and let the app work its magic, leaving your target puzzled and amused. \r\n\r\n<font color=\"red\">\ud83d\udce1 Instant Playback</font>\r\nEnjoy instant playback of your selected prank sounds at the tap of a button.\r\n\r\n<font color=\"red\">\u2764\ufe0f Favourite Soundboard</font>\r\nSave your most-loved prank sounds to a dedicated soundboard for quick and easy access. Have your favourite prank ready to go whenever an opportunity arises. \r\n\r\n<font color=\"red\">\u2705 User-Friendly Interface</font>\r\n\r\n<font color=\"blue\">\ud83d\udeab Safety note:</font>\r\nRemember, pranks are meant to be fun and light-hearted. Always ensure that your pranks are harmless and considerate. Avoid using the app in inappropriate or sensitive situations, and be mindful of the feelings of others. \r\n\r\n<font color=\"red\">DOWNLOAD SOUND PRANK: HAIR CLIPPER NOW AND ADD AN EXTRA DOSE OF HUMOUR AND JOY TO YOUR LIFE!</font>",
